{{--
  NOT pre-rendered, on purpose.

  This is an auth-gated form (`middleware: ['auth']` below), so all 2,740
  pre-rendered copies were the same login-redirect shell — pages no crawler
  should index, and a sixth of the 20,028-page build that was OOMing.

  `preview.ts` SHELL_REWRITES serves it from the non-dynamic form shell, which
  reads the id off location.pathname; the host must do the same (DEPLOY.md).
--}}

